text = "━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
Sort LOWEST to HIGHEST.
📦 PRIORITY ID:
Lower number = ships first.
Crate 10 is most urgent.
Crate 60 is least urgent.
HOW IT WORKS:
Find the MINIMUM crate in
the unsorted region.
Swap it to the leftmost
unsorted slot.
Lock it. Repeat.

HINT:
Gold crates are locked —
already in final position.
▼ HERE arrow = next slot to fill.

"
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 2

